      "exchange_attribution_boundary": "CRITICAL LIMITATION (SIH26183): Binary transaction classification (illicit vs. licit) does NOT identify cryptocurrency exchanges. In the Elliptic dataset, Class 2 (licit) includes legitimate exchanges, miners, and merchants. Illicit classification indicates transaction-level AML risk (e.g. ransomware, darknet), NOT exchange identity or fraud linkage. Exchange identification requires separate wallet clustering, deposit address reuse tracing, and off-chain attribution datasets."
